#Organize Import Order
#LINSTOR canonical import order - see docs/import-order.md
#Import in Eclipse via: Preferences > Java > Code Style > Organize Imports > Import...
#  0  com.linbit.**  (own code)
#  1  jakarta.**  \ Checkstyle treats jakarta.** and javax.** as ONE group; Eclipse cannot merge
#  2  javax.**    / prefixes, so it inserts a blank line between them (tolerated, see docs)
#  3  java.**
#  4  all other (3rd-party) imports   -> empty value = catch-all bucket
#  5  all static imports              -> \# = static catch-all, sorted last
0=com.linbit
1=jakarta
2=javax
3=java
4=
5=\#
